        "text": "Step 2: The sum of the base-2 logarithms of the roots is given as 5. This can be written as:\n\\[ \\log_2(r) + \\log_2(s) + \\log_2(t) = 5. \\]\nUsing the properties of logarithms, this can be rewritten as:\n\\[ \\log_2(rst) = 5. \\]\nThis implies:\n\\[ rst = 2^5 = 32. \\]"
